<title>NIGERIA: SOCCER-NIGERIA BEAT GUINEA 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NIGERIA BEAT GUINEA 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria beat Guinea 2-1 (halftime</p>
<p>0-0) in a World Cup African zone group one soccer qualifier on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Nigeria - Daniel Amokachi 65, 76</p>
<p>Guinea  - Titi Camara 86</p>
<p>Attendance - 50,000</p>
